# .dockerignore — repo root (the build context for infra/docker/api.Dockerfile, and
# any future Dockerfile added under infra/docker/).
#
# CRITICAL: without this file, `COPY . .` in the Dockerfile's `build` stage clobbers
# the container's own freshly `pnpm install`-ed (Linux) `node_modules` — created by
# the EARLIER `RUN pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` layer — with the HOST machine's
# `node_modules` (wrong OS/arch native bindings, Windows-style symlinks that don't
# resolve inside the Linux container, etc.), breaking the build. Confirmed by an
# actual `docker build` reproduction during Phase-7 Wave 4 devops hardening — do not
# remove this file or its `node_modules` entries.

node_modules
**/node_modules

# build outputs / caches (never needed as build INPUT — each stage builds its own)
dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
build
**/build
coverage
**/coverage
storybook-static
**/storybook-static
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# local-only / never-baked-into-an-image
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
keys

# vcs / editor / os
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# docs (not needed inside the api image)
docs
.claude
